 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "should / shouldn't 로 조언하기와 현재완료 문제 설명",
   "en": "technology problems: should, shouldn't and present perfect"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "기술 문제는 현재완료(I have forgotten my password)나 현재형(The Wi-Fi isn't working)으로 설명합니다. 조언은 should + 동사원형, 금지에 가까운 조언은 shouldn't + 동사원형을 씁니다. 개인 정보를 보호하는 습관은 기술 시대의 중요한 상식입니다.",
   "en": "Describe technology problems with the present perfect (I have forgotten my password) or the present (The Wi-Fi isn't working). Give advice with should + base verb and warnings with shouldn't + base verb. Protecting personal information is an important habit today."
  },
  "table": {
   "head": [
    "표현 / Pattern",
    "예 / Example"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
